# Subagents use caveman mode

When launching **Task** subagents or any delegated background worker in this repo, the prompt **must** include:

> Use caveman mode (full intensity) per `~/.agents/skills/caveman/SKILL.md` — terse, no fluff, full technical accuracy.

Applies to all delegated workers. Parent agent reads caveman skill before delegating if unfamiliar.
